Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.63,0:00:03.32,DefaultItalics,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,What is that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.47,0:00:06.75,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:08.73,Default,Jung Donghun,0,0,0,,Wait! You might get killed, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:09.95,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,Then what are we supposed to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:11.19,Default,Ra Hyeyoung,0,0,0,,Is there no other way out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.19,0:00:12.80,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,How the hell am I supposed to know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.99,Default,Ahn Yujung,0,0,0,,Two of us are already dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.99,0:00:17.30,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Nobody move! If you do, it'll attack again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Joohee! Joohee!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.93,0:00:26.39,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.41,0:00:31.17,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,If you hadn't noticed what was happening, \Nwe'd all be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:34.65,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Didn't you yell because you'd figured it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:37.80,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No... It just seemed dangerous...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:41.25,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Song, your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:44.21,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,If I grit my teeth, it's not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:45.91,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Can you stop the bleeding, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.70,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I was hoping to ask Joohee, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.15,0:00:53.65,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,she doesn't handle pressure well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.51,0:00:58.66,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,That's why she only takes part in easy raids,\Ndespite being a B-Rank healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:03.33,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I've been through two or three \NB-Rank dungeons myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:08.58,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,And that might be an A-Rank foe... or even S.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:13.05,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The commandments of the Cartenon Temple \Nwritten on that tablet...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.05,0:01:17.72,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,"First, revere God. Second, praise God."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.10,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,"Third, prove your faith to God."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:23.01,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,"Those who do not follow these \Nlaws will not leave alive."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:26.23,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Song... The god it's talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:28.49,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's probably that thing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:33.77,Narration,Narration,0,0,0,,Over ten years ago, tunnels known as gates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.77,0:01:37.53,Narration,Narration,0,0,0,,that connected our world to \Nan alternate dimension appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:41.29,Narration,Narration,0,0,0,,giving rise to a number of supernatural \Nphenomena throughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:48.09,Narration,Narration,0,0,0,,Those who awaken to special powers, \Nknown as hunters, are a prime example.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.59,0:01:54.19,Narration,Narration,0,0,0,,They are tasked with defeating the beasts \Nthat lie within the dungeons through gates,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:58.67,Narration,Narration,0,0,0,,and a hunter's power, \Nonce active, never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:02.85,Narration,Narration,0,0,0,,But at times, on the other side of a gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:06.65,Narration,Narration,0,0,0,,one finds monsters who inspire \Nsomething beyond mere terror—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:09.98,Narration,Narration,0,0,0,,something akin to absolute despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.13,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Did you watch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:44.28,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Oh, the video?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:48.90,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,What were you doing? \NYou almost got marked as late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:50.02,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:55.17,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Jinah, your brother's a hunter, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:56.58,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:59.23,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Well, that said, he's an E-Rank hunter...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.96,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,So he's always getting hurt real bad. \NIt seems like a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:04.37,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,He came home covered \Nin bandages the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:07.55,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Why are you asking, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:08.88,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,No real reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:12.41,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,I bet I could do a better job...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.47,0:04:15.56,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,That thing is too strong to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:18.25,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Let's collect ourselves and \Nsearch for a way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:20.28,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,It won't be—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.79,0:04:20.28,DefaultTop,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,I'm not just gonna die in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:24.31,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,I finally managed to land a contract \Nwith a major guild!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.31,0:04:27.04,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,I can't afford to bite it like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:29.16,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! You mustn't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:32.04,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,I can pull this off! \NI'm pretty confident in my speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:33.69,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,I'll get it before it gets me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.34,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:51.79,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I think this means it could \Nwipe us all out if it felt like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:55.69,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Easily, too. Like stepping on a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:59.72,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Then why doesn't it kill us right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:03.36,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It has the strength to kill us, but it hasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.71,0:05:07.45,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There's something different about it compared\Nto most beasts, which attack on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:12.95,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Song, what was the first \Ncommandment again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:14.01,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The commandments?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:17.50,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I think the first one was to revere God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.63,0:05:19.38,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,God...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:23.32,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This dungeon has its own rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:24.84,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:27.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I'm right about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:28.90,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You need to stop—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:35.85,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,From how you look, you haven't \Ngiven up on surviving this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:55.29,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Everyone! Bow your heads \Ntoward the statue, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.95,0:05:57.28,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Bow our heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:58.75,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:00.79,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Did you figure out something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:05.78,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I think so. As long as you keep \Nyour head low, it won't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:08.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"Revere God." Just like the commandment says.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:15.05,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You're sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:16.89,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yes... For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.36,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:28.28,DefaultItalics,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,This is gonna save us? This is all it takes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:37.16,DefaultItalics,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Damn, that's freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:39.12,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Its expression changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:43.98,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,It's not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:46.79,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't just get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:53.05,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Look! It's not attacking anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:56.89,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Is it really over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:58.31,Default,Ra Hyeyoung,0,0,0,,Are we safe now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:06:59.10,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.51,0:07:00.32,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:01.31,Default,Ahn Yujung,0,0,0,,We can go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:04.69,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No... There's still...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:13.78,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I thought it was over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:17.54,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Sung, what now?! You have \Nsome kind of plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:19.96,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,N-Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:24.42,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But it's probably a bad idea to break \Nthe commandments they set!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.52,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The second was to praise God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:27.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's what we need to figure out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:28.77,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Praise him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.77,0:07:30.39,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,How, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.39,0:07:32.25,Default,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,Let me give this a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:35.54,Default,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,I've been studying ethnology.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:38.76,Default,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,There are a few extolments \Nfor gods that come to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:45.11,Default,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,O God, our great ruler \Nwho brings order to the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:47.07,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Is it working?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:49.19,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,I think it might be slowing down?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.91,Default,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,Show us the path of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:54.12,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Wait. That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.24,0:07:58.08,Default,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,Thy will be done...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:01.42,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Those words don't apply to this god!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:04.59,Default,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,We revere and honor thee!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:08.67,Default,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,O God, our great ruler \Nwho brings order to the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:15.02,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:16.11,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:25.55,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous to bunch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:26.27,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Spread out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:27.13,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:30.14,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Let's run, Joohee!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:33.91,DefaultItalics,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,I can't die like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:36.60,DefaultItalics,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,I've got family waiting for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:40.04,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,I should be safe over here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:42.80,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Hey, Park! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.47,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:58.33,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Praise God... Praise God...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:03.58,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What is there to praise about that thing?! \NIt's basically a devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:08.15,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But I can't leave Joohee alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:11.87,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I need some kind of clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:14.57,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Spears... Axes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:21.79,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hammers... Swords... Instruments...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:23.49,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Instruments?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:29.95,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Everyone! Run to the statues \Nwith instruments!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:31.17,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The instruments?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:39.26,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Is it... playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:43.02,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Hey! The statues with \Ninstruments won't attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.65,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Damn it all...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:56.48,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Please, play your music! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:10:00.02,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Does it not work if there's two people?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.02,0:10:02.19,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You stay here, Joohee!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.51,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:14.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:25.02,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Not there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:29.90,Default,Joohee,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:32.11,Default,Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.27,0:10:45.16,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Not... yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.93,0:10:50.08,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:13.71,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess this is what was meant by praise?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.19,0:11:22.82,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.65,0:11:25.41,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yeah... Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.99,0:11:32.22,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:33.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.15,0:11:39.44,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Your leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:46.99,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's enough, Joohee. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:50.38,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,What are you saying?! I'm going to heal you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.01,0:11:55.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Joohee...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:58.50,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,What a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:11:59.82,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:03.45,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,It's a shame about your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:06.81,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,But you made a careless call as our leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:08.27,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I guess it's just karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:09.14,Default,Ra Hyeyoung,0,0,0,,That's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:10.26,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Kim, you were the one who—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:11.71,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Hey, we all decided together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:13.87,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,And I remember how you voted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:18.17,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I was the one who made the final call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:20.76,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for everything \Nthat's happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:23.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This is no time to be arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:25.42,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There's still one more commandment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.81,0:12:29.22,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,What's going on now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.22,0:12:30.38,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,An earthquake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:34.64,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:36.36,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,An altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:40.63,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They come up all the time in legends...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.63,0:12:43.07,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,for offering treasure \Nand sacrifices to the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.41,0:12:46.33,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The third commandment. \N"Prove your faith to God."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:51.74,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Even an idiot like me knows \Nwhat the move is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:57.10,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,We've gotta offer up a sacrifice, \Nain't that right, Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:04.11,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I saw a man who was bragging about his wife \Nbefore we came in here split down the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:05.89,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,And he wasn't the only one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:08.75,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,You said it yourself, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.10,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Well, time to take responsibility, Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:13.11,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Kim, that's—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:13.72,DefaultTop,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Enough out of you, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:18.96,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Fine. Let me go myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:23.14,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This isn't Mr. Song's fault alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:25.53,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We took a vote to decide to come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.23,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,What's happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:38.17,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Sung! Is there anything else I need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.61,0:13:42.79,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What is this? Didn't we need a sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:49.29,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'd like to examine the altar, \Nso could you help me over to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:53.79,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Get me right next to it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:55.64,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,B-But then, won't we...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:57.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't think anything will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:06.61,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Did you figure something out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:08.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Not yet, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:12.19,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If we wait here, is anyone \Nlikely to come rescue us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.19,0:14:14.94,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The gate will have been open \Nfor a week as of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:18.33,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,They'll probably start moving again \Nbefore anyone comes for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:24.45,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It takes seven days for a gate \Nto open up all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:28.61,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's what's called a dungeon break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:33.07,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,When that happens, the beasts are \Nable to cross over to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:37.20,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The other objective of raids \Nis to defeat the dungeon boss
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:40.56,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and shut the gate down \Nbefore that time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:44.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Which means if we fail here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:48.11,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That thing will be able to enter our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.89,0:14:49.82,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:53.26,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Sung! It's wonderful \Nhow you visit every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:02.21,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Mom! I'm here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:04.89,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Song-yi was late to class today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.89,0:15:08.95,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,She said she'd had stuff to do, \Nbut I'm sure she just overslept!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:13.43,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Oh, and in the national test...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.34,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Could you two come over here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:22.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We probably need a flame \Nto light up for each one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:26.04,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If anything's going to happen, \Nit'll be after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:43.38,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The door's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:44.72,Default,Ra Hyeyoung,0,0,0,,Can we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:46.17,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Unless this is a trap, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:52.67,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What was that sound?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.94,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Th-The statues are coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.56,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:59.27,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Why are they coming after us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.73,0:16:05.24,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:07.32,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Joohee, don't close your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:08.99,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They won't move if you're watching them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:12.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It works like that old children's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.09,0:16:14.49,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Everyone, keep your eyes on the statues!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:29.76,DefaultTop,Ra Hyeyoung,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:29.76,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:29.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:36.20,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What's going on here, Sung?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:39.10,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,The door closed a bit, \Nbut I think she made it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:40.56,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.94,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The blue flames have been \Ndying out over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:47.27,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,One of the orange ones went out \Nwhen someone escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:52.15,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The first order was to revere. \NThe second was to praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:54.41,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The third is to prove our faith...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.84,0:16:57.60,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It must be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:17:00.78,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Causing danger and fear, \Nand then offering a false sense of hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:04.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Maybe it's testing our faith in this god.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:07.46,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,I can't... I can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.44,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Jeongho!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.44,0:17:11.01,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:13.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.13,0:17:20.34,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.34,0:17:22.89,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If anyone else leaves, \Nwe'll have blind spots!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:25.39,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What is happening here, Sung?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:26.65,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,We need an explanation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:30.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,As long as we keep our eyes on the statues \Nand don't move, we'll be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:35.36,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The blue flames are a timer. \NWhen they're all gone, we'll all make it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:42.50,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Isn't there a chance we'll be \Ntrapped in here once they go out, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:46.57,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I'll be honest, I didn't expect you, \Nour weakest member,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.57,0:17:49.07,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,to pull off as much as you've managed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:53.65,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,The only reason we're alive \Nat all is thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:55.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Kim...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:18:01.82,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,But I've got a family waiting for me! \NI can't die just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:04.21,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I wanna make it home alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.21,0:18:06.31,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I can't take any more of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:08.34,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:14.94,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:17.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:19.57,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We have to survive this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.56,0:18:23.52,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've managed to make it before, somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.22,0:18:29.22,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The two of you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:31.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Song?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:36.22,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I think the doors will stay open \Nas long as one of us remains here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.73,0:18:39.22,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You two still have long lives \Nahead of you. You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.93,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Joohee, look after Sung for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:43.46,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:48.35,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,No... Oh, no... No...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.72,0:18:51.68,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,My legs... gave out on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:55.35,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You must've over-exerted \Nyourself healing Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:58.53,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Song. Take Joohee and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.94,0:19:01.20,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I just said I'm going to stay—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:03.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Then who's going to carry Joohee out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:05.45,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There's no time. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:08.11,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,You can't, Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.11,0:19:09.21,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,In that case, it should be me—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:12.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I promised to take you out to eat, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.62,0:19:14.49,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Use this to buy yourself dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.95,0:19:17.93,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And when I get out of here, \NI'll be along to collect the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:19.96,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,How can you even say—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:25.79,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. But it looks like \Nwe really are out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.79,0:19:26.96,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:37.78,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Good. I'm the only one who has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:41.10,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I'd known this was gonna happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.10,0:19:43.87,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I would've enrolled in a juicier \Nlife insurance package.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:52.45,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll take at least one of you down with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:54.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:08.88,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've always been the weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.43,0:20:12.23,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And I've been mocked for it, \Ntime and time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:14.19,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But I've always tried as hard as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:19.90,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:22.36,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:25.22,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's bullshit! This is such bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:30.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I tried to be stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.96,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:42.38,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And even then, \NI gave it my all to get this far!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:53.11,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You couldn't take any more? \NWe all felt the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.88,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,All you were doing was \Njustifying your own selfishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.73,0:21:01.39,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That gratitude was purely superficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.39,0:21:05.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's always the most selfish \Npeople who benefit the most!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.10,0:21:10.25,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I have a family, too! \NI wanted to make it home alive, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:20.17,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's good that I'm the only one \Nwho has to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:30.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How could you think that, \Nyou stupid hypocrite?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:36.94,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No. I don't wanna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:47.24,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If... If I had one more chance...
